{{> head pageTitle=title}}
<body>
    {{> company-header subtitle="Incident Challenge Brief"}}
    <main class="page" style="max-width: 860px;">
        <div class="page-head">
            <span class="kicker">Authorized Exercise</span>
            <h1>Rules & Scope</h1>
            <p class="page-lead">Investigate only the fictional Ellingson Mineral Corporation assets supplied by this challenge.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card callout">
            One stage requires a live phone conversation with an in-character event operator.
            Call only the number reconstructed from the supplied incident evidence and only
            during the staffed windows published by the event. Do not contact unrelated
            people, businesses, or numbers while solving the challenge.
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Allowed</h2>
            <p>Inspecting supplied pages and files, viewing source and response headers,
            decoding embedded data, and using ordinary file-analysis tools are in scope.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Not Allowed</h2>
            <p>Denial of service, password spraying, automated endpoint brute forcing,
            attacking event infrastructure, harassing the phone operator, and targeting
            third-party services are out of scope.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Operational Notes</h2>
            <p>Keep the original downloads. Submit each recovered <code>pdx{...}</code> value
            to the event scoring platform. If a phone or artifact service is unavailable,
            contact challenge staff rather than attempting alternate real-world targets.</p>
            <p>The operator will not ask for your real identity, employer, event password, or
            other private information. Caller ID and ordinary carrier call logs may still be
            visible when placing a phone call.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="links">
            <a href="/incident">Start Investigation</a>
        </div>
    </main>
    {{> footer}}
</body>
</html>
